## 📊 Results

The College Notes AI Assistant successfully demonstrates the application of Artificial Intelligence and Natural Language Processing to create an intelligent academic question-answering system.

The application allows students to upload their college notes and ask questions based on the uploaded documents. It processes the documents, retrieves relevant information, and generates contextual answers using a Large Language Model (LLM).

### Key Results

- Successfully implemented document uploading and processing functionality.
- Extracted text from uploaded academic documents.
- Implemented document chunking to divide large documents into smaller manageable sections.
- Generated embeddings to represent document content in vector form.
- Stored document embeddings for efficient similarity-based retrieval.
- Implemented Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) for contextual question answering.
- Integrated an LLM to generate natural language responses.
- Enabled students to interact with their academic notes through a conversational interface.

