### Conclusion

The College Notes AI Assistant demonstrates how Generative AI and Retrieval-Augmented Generation can simplify the process of accessing academic information.

By combining document processing, semantic search, vector embeddings, and Large Language Models, the application provides an interactive way for students to explore and understand their study materials.

It can serve as a foundation for developing more advanced AI-powered educational assistance systems.

